WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.860
Warning: This feature contains themes that
some viewers may find offensive.

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:08.059
If you are affected by any of the content
in this video please contact literally anyone

00:00:08.059 --> 00:00:09.059
