00:00:09.059 --> 00:00:10.960
Hey Thoughty2 here.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:14.430
Before I begin I would like to say that this
video will be a bit different to normal because

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:18.960
it will contain a lot of opinion, but I feel
so passionately about this topic that it needs

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:19.960
to be addressed.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:24.109
If you’re used to my usual style of fact-based
videos and you aren’t comfortable hearing

00:00:24.109 --> 00:00:29.759
opinions that you may not agree with then
I kindly ask that you give this video a miss.

00:00:29.759 --> 00:00:34.859
So if you’ve watched the news, read the
papers or used any kind of social media within

00:00:34.859 --> 00:00:40.010
the last few years you may have noticed an
unsavoury trend that has been increasing with

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:42.850
seemingly exponential virality.

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:46.079
Everyone is getting offended by everything.

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:52.199
Whether you have been witness to it or not
there is an ever growing number of ultra-politically-correct

00:00:52.199 --> 00:00:58.829
far-left militants that are hellbent on campaigning
for a cause for people whom they’ve never

00:00:58.829 --> 00:01:03.690
met and who never asked them to campaign for
them in the first place.

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:09.820
And no, this isn’t about politics, it’s
far more serious than that, this is about

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:18.080
maintaining our freedoms and rights as a human
race, and no, sadly, I’m not exaggerating.

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:23.760
If you’re not quite sure what the hell I’m
going on about, let me tell you about a fairly

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:29.590
recent event that just goes to prove my point
about how deadly political correctness can

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:30.840
be.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:37.579
In November 2009 a psychologist working in
the US army, Nidal Malik Hasan, opened fire

00:01:37.579 --> 00:01:45.969
on the other troops in the base, whilst shouting
“God is Great” in Arabic, 13 people were

00:01:45.969 --> 00:01:46.969
killed.

00:01:46.969 --> 00:01:52.400
It was soon discovered that the Pentagon knew
all about Hasan’s radical ideologies way

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.810
before this act of terrorism.

00:01:54.810 --> 00:02:00.780
They were aware of a whole bunch of emails
he had been sending to other radical Muslims.

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:05.670
Even his own colleagues at the army base had
expressed their discomfort about him to others,

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:09.940
saying that he was a “ticking time bomb”.

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:17.340
So how on Earth could the US government and
the senior army management simply allow this

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:21.440
horrific mass murder to happen?

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:27.569
Because the powers that be in the US army
were too afraid of being accused of racially

00:02:27.569 --> 00:02:31.709
profiling someone to take any action.

00:02:31.709 --> 00:02:37.530
And so because of the unyielding pressure
of political correctness in the modern age,

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:43.330
13 people tragically had to die.

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:47.680
The effects of the over-offended can be seen
strongly in comedy.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:53.629
The sixties, seventies and eighties were full
of original, geniusly witty tv comedies that

00:02:53.629 --> 00:02:59.310
have yet to be bettered, such as Monty Python,
Fawlty Towers, Blackadder, Yes Minister and

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:03.440
a handful of others which I’m sure you all
have fond memories of but there are too many

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:04.730
to name here.

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:09.599
But each and every one of these shows delved
into the realm of what overly sensitive people

00:03:09.599 --> 00:03:15.040
today might wrongly call sexist, homophobic
or racist.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:20.409
One notable example is what many people consider
to be the greatest 30 minutes of TV comedy

00:03:20.409 --> 00:03:25.600
ever written and performed, the Fawlty Towers
episode “The Germans”.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:32.200
The whole 30 minutes is stuffed full of non-PC
jokes that wouldn’t dare be part of any

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:34.799
contemporary TV sitcom.

00:03:34.799 --> 00:03:40.319
One particular scene shows a resident of Fawlty
Towers, Major Gowen using racial slurs against

00:03:40.319 --> 00:03:42.709
West Indians and Germans.

00:03:42.709 --> 00:03:50.110
Sadly, due to the increasingly sensitive nature
of some TV viewers today, this scene is now

00:03:50.110 --> 00:03:55.520
cut by the BBC from the episode, whenever
they air it on TV.

00:03:55.520 --> 00:04:01.659
But what people fail to see is that the writers
John Cleese and Connie Booth are by no means

00:04:01.659 --> 00:04:08.269
supporting such racial slurs, they are in
fact doing the opposite, they are making a

00:04:08.269 --> 00:04:13.720
joke out of the Major’s (a completely fictional
character) ignorance and prejudice towards

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:16.380
other cultures and races.

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:19.920
And that is just totally fine.

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:25.720
Because racism is wrong and we should make
fun of those who practice it.

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:32.860
So how is it that I can I so confidently say
that such TV moments were categorically not

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:40.360
racist, well, for one simple reason, it is
comedy.

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:43.260
Comedy should have no bounds.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:49.590
When horrendous, unthinkable things happen
such as war, the holocaust, slavery, disease

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:55.420
and oppression, it is human nature to want
to make things better, unless of course you

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:57.630
are the one causing said suffering.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:02.860
And we can often make good of any bad situation
by simply having a laugh.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:09.060
During the war and the great depression, comedy
sitcoms and talk shows were broadcast on radio

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:12.420
stations all day, every day.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:16.700
Such shows would often attract audiences of
30 million plus listeners.

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:22.600
30 million people wanted to listen to comedy
in the middle of a war.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:28.790
Because when the chips are down and all seems
lost, it’s the small things that really

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:35.080
matter, it might just be that moment of laughter
one gets from a comedy sketch on the radio.

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:41.390
It might trivialise the seemingly insurmountable
issues you are facing by poking fun at them,

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:49.800
and so making them just seem a little bit
less horrible, and slightly more tolerable.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:55.770
Being intentionally prejudice towards a specific
group of people is a horrible thing but when

00:05:55.770 --> 00:06:01.970
we are forced to conform to extreme political
correctness it only strips away our freedom

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:05.840
of speech and our ability to express ourselves.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:11.770
Today’s stand up comedians have fallen victim
to the ever tightening pc noose around their

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:13.710
creative necks.

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:19.920
More so than ever comedians are having to
censor their own material, making it less

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:25.760
offensive and more politically correct, just
to appease what many journalists are calling

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:29.480
the “snowflake generation”.

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:34.890
Certain british comedians such as Ricky Gervais,
Jimmy Carr and Frankie Boyle have been reprimanded

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:44.120
repeatedly by British television regulators
Ofcom because they have been forced to do

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:50.790
so after numerous complaints by over-offended
tv viewers who feel that they are entitled

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:56.580
to restrict a comedian’s freedom of speech.

00:06:56.580 --> 00:07:01.780
The issue is intensified by the fact that
the snowflake generation are using social

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:10.020
media such as Twitter to publicly ridicule
and beat down any comedian who uses anti-PC

00:07:10.020 --> 00:07:12.150
language in their comedy.

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:18.760
And so many comedians are too afraid to write
the material they truly want to, they are

00:07:18.760 --> 00:07:24.850
scared of what the public reaction may be
if their content isn’t entirely family friendly,

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:28.330
and how drastically sad is that.

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:36.210
But the ironic thing is, the snowflake crowd
are in many ways doing the complete opposite

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:38.460
of what they seek to achieve.

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:44.130
Instead of censoring offensive comedy, some
comedians are now purposely being as offensive

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:49.990
as possible with their material, in a backlash
to the easily offended populus.

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:57.210
As a way to fight back against liberal oppression
and say that it’s okay to be a little offensive

00:07:57.210 --> 00:08:04.560
from time to time, because we are humans,
we are not perfect, and sometimes joining

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:11.720
in on a joke, even if it is at one’s own
expense, can be a most joyous thing.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:17.240
But sadly there is a dark side to comedians
pushing offensive humour as far as it can

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:18.510
go.

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:24.680
Because it tends to skew more towards simple-minded
toilet humor, slapstick and an overwhelming

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:31.340
amount of forced bad-language and sex jokes,
this all takes the place of what previously

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:37.680
could have been well-thought out, witty humour
that uses offense as a natural and organic

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:43.330
part of the joke instead of being forced into
the material in an unnatural, belligerent

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:46.140
and obviously artificial fashion.

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:52.830
But sadly, no matter how hard comedians attempt
to fight back against the snowflakes, the

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:58.120
reality is they do wield power, because of
advertisers.

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:05.860
Because today so many people are too quick
to lodge complaints against television broadcasters,

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:13.060
and other companies, TV executives are too
afraid to invest money into original writing

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:20.220
talent just because it may be too “edgy”
or offensive for certain demographics of their

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:21.220
viewership.

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:28.140
And the problem is made even worse as TV broadcasters
are held at the mercy of their advertisers.

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:33.740
Today advertisers recognise the power of the
snowflake crowd and their ability to rant

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:40.200
and rave on social media about their brand
if they are seen as being slightly offensive

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:47.680
or prejudice and so advertisers will point-blank
refuse to advertise on shows that could be

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:51.700
construed as offensive, by pretty much anyone.

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:57.580
And if the advertising money isn’t there
a show will never be broadcast, no matter

00:09:57.580 --> 00:09:58.920
how good it is.

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:04.770
We’ve all seen this exact same issue here
on YouTube in recent years.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:10.250
To protect advertisers and their all important
revenue streams YouTube has introduced new

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:16.810
measures to aggressively censor any content
creator that produce slightly edgy content,

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:21.750
by stripping away their advertising revenue.

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:28.620
I make a lot of videos about history and War
is a prominent feature of our history that

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:37.140
should be openly talked about so we can learn
from our mistakes.

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:44.320
But any video that so much mentions the word
war has been entirely stripped of advertisements,

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:50.180
because god forbid someone out there is offended
by a recount of accurate historical events.

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:56.420
But we can’t blame YouTube or even the advertisers
for this mass censorship.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:11:03.160
It’s not their fault, they are just responding
to what the public wants to protect their

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:06.720
revenues and any business would probably do
the same thing.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:12.130
It is the easily-offended, the complainers,
those that are quick to reprimand people who

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:19.670
seek to speak freely and unimpeded, that are
the ones truly responsible, they are the rotten

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:21.200
core.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:27.520
The true cause of what will inevitably be
a rapid decline in creativity.

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:31.050
But is it really that wrong to be offended?

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:36.680
No, of course it’s not, everyone gets offended
from time to time, it is natural, it is human

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:42.370
nature to take a dislike to comments or actions
that cause us upset.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:49.870
The public have always taken offense, that’s
not new, what is new and what is the true

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:57.730
problem today is people’s feeling of entitlement.

00:11:57.730 --> 00:12:04.290
Because many millennials, especially in the
West, have grown up in a time free of war,

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:11.090
free of oppression and poverty they have never
known what it’s like to not have everything,

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:12.980
to not get what they want.

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:20.810
This has instilled in many a feeling of gross
entitlement, a feeling that them being offended

00:12:20.810 --> 00:12:25.420
actually means something.

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:31.120
Let me tell you straight, being offended doesn’t
mean anything.

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:38.040
It’s a natural human response and it’s
okay to be offended or even disgusted at other

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:43.860
people’s actions but it absolutely doesn’t
give you the right to control how others behave

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:44.860
and talk.

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:49.279
If someone calls you stupid you rightly should
be offended, but that doesn’t mean you can

00:12:49.279 --> 00:12:55.850
start a campaign to prevent people from using
the word stupid, that’s a little something

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:57.660
called oppression.

00:12:57.660 --> 00:13:03.300
Don’t get me wrong I’m not talking about
every young person out there, far from it.

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:06.300
I’m simply referring to a small minority.

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:12.160
But as is often the case in life, it is the
few that spoil it for the many.

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:17.810
But why is being so openly offended and making
sure everyone possible knows how utterly offended

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:21.530
you are, such a bad thing?

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:29.240
Well there is a fundamental problem with being
offended and making a big deal of it.

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:32.140
Offensive is subjective.

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:37.080
What each of us is offended by is vastly different
from person to person.

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:42.410
What offends us depends on our social and
economic background, our religious views or

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:47.331
lack of, the friendships you’ve had, how
you were brought up, where you live, your

00:13:47.331 --> 00:13:55.380
political affiliation, your ethnicity, sexuality,
age, gender, even your diet.

00:13:55.380 --> 00:14:01.140
And just because you are offended by a specific
thing it does not mean that the rest of the

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:07.550
world should be, because we are all unique
and varied, and if we weren't then we would

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:13.400
all be exactly the same and have the same
beliefs and that doesn’t sound like much

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:15.500
fun, does it?

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:18.850
My point is, where does it stop?

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:24.070
I’m offended by people who drink instant
coffee, but am I going to protest against

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:26.910
it or call the police?

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:33.029
No because me being offended doesn’t matter,
it gives me no rights, and it’s not my place

00:14:33.029 --> 00:14:35.100
to tell others how to behave.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:44.160
At the end of the day, no one is being harmed,
no crime has been committed.

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:49.620
Everyone out there is offended by different
things, you can guarantee that no matter what

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:55.960
you think of, there will be someone in the
world who finds it offensive, you can never

00:14:55.960 --> 00:15:01.830
fully police every thought, freedom of speech
and people’s behaviours because doing so

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:06.690
would be trying to police everyone and everything
that they say.

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:12.940
The so-called snowflake generation are trying
to police thought and free speech and the

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:18.630
totally ironic thing is that the vast majority
of the millennial mind police would consider

00:15:18.630 --> 00:15:20.670
themselves to be very liberal.

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:26.060
Now I don’t know about you, but I would
say that attempting to prevent people from

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:31.440
thinking a certain way, from saying what they
want and stopping them from behaving in a

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:39.050
natural and human way is the opposite of liberal,
it’s actually incredibly facist.

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:43.730
And to make matters worse, it’s not just
the public that are getting offended too easily.

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:45.890
It’s our governments too.

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:52.610
As was demonstrated with a very recent and
shocking case in Scotland.

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:59.130
Scottish comedian and YouTuber Mark Meechan
posted a video on YouTube in which he explained

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:04.330
that he is sick of his girlfriend thinking
that absolutely everything her pet pug does

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:10.140
is adorable and cute and so he thought it
would be funny to teach the pug to do the

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:19.600
least cute and most horrific thing he could
think of, which is of course, being a Nazi.

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:25.800
So, upon hearing the command “gas the jews”
the pug would raise he stubby little leg in

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:29.680
what we would infer to be a Nazi salute.

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:34.399
Now of course the hilarious thing about this
is that this adorable little pug has no idea

00:16:34.399 --> 00:16:37.300
what it is doing, it is completely dead pan.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:44.540
And that juxtaposition between the cute and
the horrific makes for a really funny video.

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:51.650
Is Mark Meechan supporting the views, ideologies
and actions of the Nazis, no.

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:58.399
Does making and posting this video online
make him a neo nazi or supporter of anti semitism,

00:16:58.399 --> 00:17:01.170
absolutely not.

00:17:01.170 --> 00:17:07.280
Because it was intended as comedy and no more
than that and there categorically should be

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:10.569
no rules when it comes to comedy.

00:17:10.569 --> 00:17:17.270
Sure some people may find it insensitive but
I’m sorry, you either have to have free

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:21.959
speech or nothing at all, especially when
it comes to comedy.

00:17:21.959 --> 00:17:26.819
Because as soon as you start to draw lines
between what is okay to make fun of and what

00:17:26.819 --> 00:17:34.420
isn’t you start policing people’s thoughts
and people’s speech and that is just a slippery

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:40.860
slope into a war on intelligence and rational
thought, two things that we must fight to

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:45.140
defend, no matter the cost.

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:50.059
After being posted on Reddit, Meechan’s
video went viral gathering 3 million views.

00:17:50.059 --> 00:17:54.650
Subsequently Meechan was arrested on suspicion
of hate crime.

00:17:54.650 --> 00:18:02.550
In March 2018 he faced trial in court and
in what was a very sad day for freedom of

00:18:02.550 --> 00:18:08.809
speech, meechan was found guilty and sentenced
to a fine of £800.

00:18:08.809 --> 00:18:14.910
£800 may not seem like a heavy sentence,
but the very fact that there was a trial at

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:22.120
all and even worse that a guilty verdict was
reached is a very sad precedent for democracy,

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:27.920
free speech and everything that makes being
a human, being free and being able to express

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:32.040
oneself so great and so precious.

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:37.680
In the words of Mark Meechan himself “when
you start jailing comedians for making jokes,

00:18:37.680 --> 00:18:40.050
you’re heading down a slippery slope”.

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:43.530
And my god he couldn’t be more right.

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:48.220
I’m not being overly-dramatic when I say
that this decision sets an incredibly dangerous

00:18:48.220 --> 00:18:55.790
precedent that we should make all of us very
worried about the future of free speech.

00:18:55.790 --> 00:19:01.240
The judge tried to put forward the ridiculously
absurd case that Meechan’s video was not

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:08.110
intended as comedy but was instead some kind
of Nazi propaganda with a goal to unite the

00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:13.000
masses in the act of gassing jews, and the
cute pug was only a way to disguise his true

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.040
evil and malicious intent.

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:19.500
I’m not pulling your leg, that is what the
court genuinely said.

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:23.440
This is obviously a load of crap as it was
unquestionably comedy.

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:30.220
But one has to ask, by sentencing Meechan
for making this comedy video, aren’t the

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:34.900
court suppressing free speech just like the
Nazis did.

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:41.179
Didn’t we fight against the Nazis to preserve
our ability to speak and act freely and avoid

00:19:41.179 --> 00:19:44.250
totalitarian oppression?

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:50.040
So it begs the question, who is really exercising
Nazi ideals here?

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:57.270
The only thing that was nice to see was the
overwhelming public support for Mark Meechan,

00:19:57.270 --> 00:20:01.060
in defense of his ill treatment by the court.

00:20:01.060 --> 00:20:07.130
Many comedians also spoke out publicly defending
Meechan’s actions, namely Ricky Gervais.

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:13.020
Providing hope that rational thought and a
desire for free speech are still well and

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:15.600
alive within our society.

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:19.240
Let’s just hope we can keep it that way.

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:25.160
So to finish up, I implore you, the next time
someone gets offended and complains at you

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:30.980
for sitting the wrong way in public, for eating
meat, for using gender

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:37.540
pronouns, for openly supporting your favourite
political party, for casually flirting with

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:44.710
a stranger, for innocently touching another
human being, for praying to your chosen deity,

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:50.380
for earning more money than someone else,
for making a simple joke or simply because

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:55.990
you don’t identify as a non-conforming gender-fluid
pansexual cabbage.

00:20:55.990 --> 00:21:00.760
Do not stand for it, not for a moment.

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:05.559
Because at the end of the day, you are only
being yourself, and believe me, there’s

00:21:05.559 --> 00:21:08.380
absolutely nothing wrong with that.

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:14.860
If simply being yourself and doing what you
know and what comes natural to you offends

00:21:14.860 --> 00:21:20.910
somebody else, then it’s their problem to
deal with, don’t let them make it yours

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:24.250
or anybody else’s.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:32.110
Thanks for watching.

